================================================================================
4. CORTEX AI EXTRACTION (SNOWFLAKE.CORTEX.COMPLETE)
================================================================================
Prompt to CoCo:
  "Use SNOWFLAKE.CORTEX.COMPLETE('llama3.1-70b') to extract all 20 supplier SLA
   commitments from the raw contract text. Parse the unstructured document into
   structured JSON with supplier_id, supplier_name, country, otd_commitment_pct,
   penalty_clause, contract_start, and contract_end. Then LATERAL FLATTEN the
   JSON array into the SUPPLIER_CONTRACT_SLAS table."

Extraction SQL Core:
  SNOWFLAKE.CORTEX.COMPLETE(
    'llama3.1-70b',
    'Extract ALL supplier SLA commitments from the following contract document.
     Return ONLY a valid JSON array...'
    || doc_text
  )

Result:
  20 rows extracted and inserted into SUPPLY_CHAIN_DB.ANALYTICS.SUPPLIER_CONTRACT_SLAS
  All supplier IDs, names, countries, OTD targets, penalties, and dates correctly parsed
  Extraction method: SNOWFLAKE.CORTEX.COMPLETE(llama3.1-70b)
  Zero manual data entry — fully automated AI extraction

