5. SLA VS ACTUAL OTD COMPARISON (V_SLA_VS_ACTUAL_OTD)
================================================================================
View Created:
  SUPPLY_CHAIN_DB.ANALYTICS.V_SLA_VS_ACTUAL_OTD

Query:
  Joins SUPPLIER_CONTRACT_SLAS (extracted SLA targets) with FCT_PURCHASE_ORDERS
  (actual delivery data) to compute gap and SLA compliance status per supplier.

Results (20 suppliers):
  BREACH (actual < target - 3pts):   10 suppliers
  WARNING (within 3pts of target):    4 suppliers
  MEETING SLA (actual >= target):     6 suppliers

Top SLA Breaches:
  Siemens Industrial:     SLA 96% vs Actual 72.22% (gap: -23.78pts) — BREACH
