CONCLUSION
================================================================================
This demonstrates end-to-end document intelligence:
  Unstructured contract text
    -> Cortex AI extraction (SNOWFLAKE.CORTEX.COMPLETE)
      -> Structured Snowflake table
        -> Joined with governed operational data
          -> Actionable SLA compliance insights in Streamlit

The same pipeline pattern can be applied to any supplier contract, RFQ document,
or compliance agreement — making it a reusable pattern for enterprise procurement.
